<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 18.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blossom Forever (built 1992) 38,852 dwt del S.Africa end Dec/early Jan redel Far East $7,500 daily plus $130,000 bonus M&amp;R.</p>
<p>New Moon (built 1981) 21,380 dwt del Hong Kong prompt redel S Korea $4,800 daily Samsun.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
